## 交叉编译

嵌入式开发需要交叉编译到目标架构。

```bash
# 添加目标平台
rustup target add thumbv7em-none-eabihf

# 编译
cargo build --target thumbv7em-none-eabihf --release

# 烧录（使用 probe-rs）
cargo flash --chip STM32F411CEUx --release
```

常见嵌入式目标：

| Target                        | 架构          | 典型芯片        |
| ----------------------------- | ------------- | --------------- |
| `thumbv6m-none-eabi`          | Cortex-M0/M0+ | RP2040, STM32F0 |
| `thumbv7em-none-eabihf`       | Cortex-M4F/M7 | STM32F4, nRF52  |
| `riscv32imc-unknown-none-elf` | RISC-V        | ESP32-C3        |
| `aarch64-unknown-none`        | AArch64 裸机  | Raspberry Pi    |

