## no_std 与 std 兼容库

编写同时支持 `no_std` 和 `std` 的库：

```rust
#![cfg_attr(not(feature = "std"), no_std)]

#[cfg(feature = "alloc")]
extern crate alloc;

#[cfg(feature = "alloc")]
use alloc::vec::Vec;

pub fn sum(data: &[i32]) -> i32 {
    data.iter().sum()
}

#[cfg(feature = "alloc")]
pub fn collect_even(data: &[i32]) -> Vec<i32> {
    data.iter().filter(|&&x| x % 2 == 0).copied().collect()
}
```

```toml
# Cargo.toml
[features]
default = ["std"]
std = ["alloc"]
alloc = []
```

